# Isolated production WebView + native Send; fake delivery, never real agents.
# Prerequisite: -PartifactPreview :artifact-preview:assembleDebug installed.
clearlog
shell am instrument -w dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.ReceiptInstrumentation
log artifact receipt signature PASS
nolog artifact receipt FAIL
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez questions true
tap listening-room.html
expect Choose answers in the mockup.
clearlog
tap Beside chat
scrollto Which screen sizes should we check?
tap Cover
expect Send:
expect Layout: Beside chat
expect Checks: Cover
nolog artifact answer 1
tap The wide screen with the form beside chat.
expect Checks: Cover, Unfolded
nolog artifact answer 1
shot questions-cover-native-ready
tap Send:
expect Sent to phone:A
log artifact answer 1 to phone:A
nolog artifact answer 2
shot questions-cover-native-sent
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez questions true
tap listening-room.html
clearlog
tap Full screen
# Pane-local swipes: scrollto's centre swipe lands on the unfolded divider.
swipe 0.75 0.80 0.75 0.35 500
swipe 0.75 0.80 0.75 0.35 500
tap Cover
expect Send:
expect Layout: Full screen
expect Checks: Cover
nolog artifact answer 1
shot questions-unfolded-native-ready
tap Send:
expect Sent to phone:A
log artifact answer 1 to phone:A
nolog artifact answer 2
shot questions-unfolded-native-sent
[phone] In a real mockup, changes to options/Other update the native Send label below the WebView. Page scripts may only fill/clear that draft: without native Send, no agent message, signature or Canvas receipt. On native Send verify only the labelled latest answers reach the fixed agent, with honest status and approval receipt after owner linking. Null/invalid data clears Send, artifact version change clears pending, double tap/reload does not duplicate. Unknown recipients and live URLs cannot deliver; no soma.approve. Test real Mac acknowledgement/offline status. Both cover and unfolded native bars remain accessible with long answers and the IME.
